    <ThingDef ParentName="BaseTEGun">
        <defName>TE_KineticRifle</defName>
        <label>kinetic rifle</label>
        <description>Tisiphone Enterprise Type-3 "Tyrant" kinetic blast rifle.

It doesn’t kill cleanly. That’s the point.

The Tyrant is the standard-issue rifle of the Tisiphone Hunter Contingent—built for close-quarters combat and designed with one purpose: deliver blunt-force trauma at high speed and with zero remorse. Firing high-velocity kinetic slugs that hit like a sledgehammer, the Tyrant trades range and raw damage for a brutally efficient firing cycle with rock-hard stopping power.

It’s paired with a cutting-edge targeting system for rapid acquisition and active tracking—because when you’re hunting Federation stragglers through the ruins of their sins, hesitation isn’t just dangerous. It’s disrespectful.</description>
        <graphicData>
            <texPath>Things/Weapons/Tyrant</texPath>
            <graphicClass>Graphic_Single</graphicClass>
        </graphicData>
        <soundInteract>Interact_ChargeRifle</soundInteract>
        <weaponTags>
            <li>SpacerGun</li>
        </weaponTags>
        <statBases>
            <Mass>3.35</Mass>
            <WorkToMake>50800</WorkToMake>
            <AccuracyTouch>0.75</AccuracyTouch>
            <AccuracyShort>0.8</AccuracyShort>
            <AccuracyMedium>0.65</AccuracyMedium>
            <AccuracyLong>0.5</AccuracyLong>
            <RangedWeapon_Cooldown>0.55</RangedWeapon_Cooldown>
        </statBases>
        <costList>
            <Steel>40</Steel>
            <Plasteel>40</Plasteel>
            <ComponentSpacer>2</ComponentSpacer>
        </costList>
        <verbs>
            <li>
                <verbClass>Verb_Shoot</verbClass>
                <hasStandardCommand>true</hasStandardCommand>
                <defaultProjectile>Bullet_Tyrant</defaultProjectile>
                <warmupTime>0.5</warmupTime>
                <range>26</range>
                <burstShotCount>1</burstShotCount>
                <soundCast>Shot_ChargeRifle</soundCast>
                <soundCastTail>GunTail_Medium</soundCastTail>
                <muzzleFlashScale>8</muzzleFlashScale>
            </li>
        </verbs>
    </ThingDef>

