        <defName>TE_KineticPistol</defName>
        <label>kinetic pistol</label>
        <description>Tisiphone Enterprise Type-6 “Tormentor” Kinetic Blast Pistol

Quick. Cruel. Personal.

The Tormentor is the standard-issue sidearm of the Tisiphone Hunter Contingent—a hair-raising fast kinetic pistol designed for close-range ambushes, executions, and anything else that requires both speed and spite. With an exceptionally short firing cycle—even by pistol standards—it excels in hit-and-run engagements where every fraction of a millisecond counts. It delivers blunt-force kinetic trauma with high stopping power, making it less of a sidearm and more of a pocket-sized vendetta.</description>
