    <ThingDef ParentName="BaseTEGun">
        <defName>TE_ThuddGun</defName>
        <label>thudd gun</label>
        <description>Tisiphone Enterprise Type-11 “Oppressor” Kinetic Canister Launcher

For when there are too many of them, and not enough of you.

The Oppressor is Tisiphone’s answer to crowd control—assuming the crowd isn’t meant to survive. Firing charged kinetic canisters that detonate in area-blast shockwaves, it’s a close-range weapon by design, but don’t let that fool you: it remains deadly even at its farthest reach.

The Oppressor doesn’t care much about precision. And why should it? Accuracy is a concern when you're aiming at a person. The Oppressor is aimed at problems—plural. It sends a message to massed Federation auxiliaries, swarming Seekers, and anything else foolish enough to cluster. Loudly. Repeatedly. Permanently.</description>
