    <ThingDef ParentName="BaseTEGun">
        <defName>TE_KineticLongRifle</defName>
        <label>kinetic long rifle</label>
        <description>Tisiphone Enterprise Type-4 “Wailer” Kinetic Blast Rifle

Sniper rifles are supposed to be patient. The Wailer is not.

The Wailer is a fast-firing kinetic marksman rifle engineered for one job: outshoot the Federation’s finest before they finish exhaling. Built for rapid counter-sniper operations, it combines high stopping power with blisteringly fast target acquisition—unusual for its class, and deeply unpleasant for anything downrange. Rather than vaporize its targets, the Wailer prefers to break them apart—bone, armor, and confidence included. Blunt-force slugs. Rage in physical form. Fired fast enough to erase the idea of a fair fight.</description>
