    <ThingDef ParentName="BaseTEGun">
        <defName>TE_StormCannon</defName>
        <label>singularity projector</label>
        <description>Tisiphone Enterprise Type-22 “Atrocity” Area Suppression System

It doesn’t kill quickly. That’s what makes it cruel.

The Atrocity is an area suppression weapon designed not to eliminate enemies, but to break their momentum, scatter their ranks, and remind them they’re not in control. Firing concentrated volleys of low-damage kinetic blasts, it slows movement, distorts formations, and grinds assaults to a halt. It’s not an assault weapon. It’s a disciplinary tool—with range. Feared more for what it denies than what it destroys, the Atrocity earned its name the honest way: through long minutes of confusion, pain, and frustration, delivered in kinetic blasts.</description>
